+
 	/*
 	 * Perform client authentication if necessary, then figure out our
 	 * postgres user ID, and see if we are a superuser.
 	 *
-	 * In standalone mode, autovacuum worker processes and slot sync worker
-	 * process, we use a fixed ID, otherwise we figure it out from the
-	 * authenticated user name.
+	 * In recovery standalone mode, autovacuum worker processes and slot sync
+	 * worker process, we use a fixed ID.  A prepared trusted client has no HBA
+	 * exchange, but still resolves the host-authenticated name through the
